3. Continuous Integration Tools
Tool: Jenkins

Use: Automates the integration and testing of code changes in real-time.
Why Jenkins?
Earlier tools like CruiseControl and manual testing processes were rigid, difficult to configure, and lacked plugin ecosystems.
Jenkins, with its open-source nature and extensive plugin support, became the backbone for CI pipelines.
Drawbacks of Manual CI:
Increased integration failures.
Lack of feedback loops and visibility
